---
---

<footer class="bg-stone-950 text-stone-300 border-t border-stone-800 pb-28 md:pb-12 text-sm">
  {/* Upper footer */}
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
      {/* Col 1: Brand & Credibility */}
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2C12 2 8 8 8 13C8 16.5 10.5 19 12 19C13.5 19 16 16.5 16 13C16 8 12 2 12 2ZM12 17C11.2 17 9.8 15.2 9.8 13C9.8 10.4 11.5 6.4 12 5.1C12.5 6.4 14.2 10.4 14.2 13C14.2 15.2 12.8 17 12 17Z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-xl font-serif font-black tracking-wider text-white">
              AN GIA TỊNH
            </span>
            <span class="block text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
              Không Gian Thờ Chuẩn Lỗ Ban
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Chuyên biệt không gian thờ tự hiện đại cho chung cư và nhà phố cao cấp. Tinh hoa mộc thủ công Sơn Đồng & Canh Nậu — Thạch Thất kết hợp giải pháp kiến trúc tối giản.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-stone-900/90 border border-stone-800 text-xs space-y-2">
          <p class="font-bold text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
            </svg>
            Cam Kết Chất Lượng Vàng:
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-300 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            100% Gỗ lõi tự nhiên không pha rác (Đền bù 200%)
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-300 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            Gửi clip mộc 15s duyệt thớ vân trước khi phun sơn
          </p>
          <p class="text-stone-300 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            Bảo hành mối mọt, cong vênh 10 – 20 năm
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Col 2: Products */}
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-5 pb-2.5 border-b border-stone-800 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Mẫu Bàn Thờ Lỗ Ban</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-400/80 font-normal">38.8 cm</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Ban thờ treo chung cư 48x81cm</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Hỷ Sự</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Ban thờ treo chung cư 48x89cm</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Thêm Phúc</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Ban thờ đứng 61x107cm kèm tủ cơm</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Quý Tử</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Tranh Trúc Chỉ hoa sen đèn LED</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Hào Quang</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Vách ngăn CNC chữ Thọ / Vạn</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Chắn Gió</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-between group">
              <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">Tấm chống ám khói trần thạch cao</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Trang Trí</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Col 3: Knowledge & Links */}
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-5 pb-2.5 border-b border-stone-800">
          Cẩm Nang Phong Thủy
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/thuoc-lo-ban" class="text-amber-400 font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/>
              </svg>
              <span>Tra Cứu Thước Lỗ Ban 38.8cm Online</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kien-thuc" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors block">
              Văn khấn an vị bàn thờ & bao sái bát hương
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kien-thuc" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors block">
              Bí quyết nhận biết gỗ mít ta, gụ lào, gõ đỏ
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kien-thuc" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors block">
              Hướng đặt bàn thờ hợp mệnh gia chủ chung cư
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kien-thuc" class="hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors block">
              Quy trình sấy lò 10-12% chống nứt nẻ
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Col 4: Workshop Addresses */}
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-widest mb-5 pb-2.5 border-b border-stone-800">
          Hệ Thống Xưởng Mộc
        </h4>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-3 text-stone-400">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-white block font-medium">Xưởng Thạch Thất:</strong>
            Làng nghề Canh Nậu, huyện Thạch Thất, Hà Nội
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-white block font-medium">Xưởng Đồ Thờ Sơn Đồng:</strong>
            Làng nghề Sơn Đồng, huyện Hoài Đức, Hà Nội
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-white block font-medium">Xưởng Thi Công Đại Quy Mô:</strong>
            Huyện Đoan Hùng, Tỉnh Phú Thọ
          </p>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-stone-800">
            <span class="text-amber-400 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              Hotline Tư Vấn Nghệ Nhân:
            </span>
            <a href="tel:0339533380" class="text-white text-xl font-bold font-mono hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors inline-block mt-1">
              0339.533.380
            </a>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 block mt-0.5">Hỗ trợ phong thủy & duyệt mộc 24/7</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Lower Copyright */}
  <div class="border-t border-stone-900 bg-stone-950/80">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-stone-500">
      <p>© 2026 An Gia Tịnh. Thương hiệu nội thất phòng thờ hiện đại & đồ thờ phong thủy chuẩn mực.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/thuoc-lo-ban" class="hover:text-stone-300 transition-colors">Thước Lỗ Ban 38.8cm</a>
        <a href="/san-pham" class="hover:text-stone-300 transition-colors">Sản Phẩm</a>
        <a href="/kien-thuc" class="hover:text-stone-300 transition-colors">Cẩm Nang</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
